<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 1.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES-AUG 1.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the headlines on Kuku Raadio  at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch  for their accuracy:</p>
<p>- Tallinna Heating to raise heating tariffs to cover increased investment.</p>
<p>- Due to a failure to reach an agreement between a local provider  and Eurosport, 8,000 Tallinn homes will no longer see Eurosport and  will not be able to watch the World Championship Games starting in  Athens today.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
